include locations/global

Bind Npc 18004 Zone 21

Quest 76 "Transferring Nation"
    Journal "If you want to restore your clan after transferring, then seek [Grand Merchant] Kaishan."

On topics
    Topic "Transferring Nation" goto event_699

On accept
    Goto event_699

On event_699
    If player has 810096000
        Say "Change your character to the nation you want, and click OK to transfer your Nation. Don't be surprised if the game automatically disconnects."
        Topic "Move out" goto event_700
        Topic "Reconsider" goto close
    Else
        Say "Well... to transfer your Nation, you should bring the Nation Transfer Certificate needed for a Nation transfer. You can buy the Nation Transfer Certificate at the PowerUP Store."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map power_up_item

On event_700
    Open nation transfer panel
